 * Declares the AdvanceSymFormatting trait.
 *
 * This trait, implemented by the base Symbol class, provides recursive
 * formatting utilities for printing a symbol and its entire symbol table
 * hierarchy. It is used by the Formatter to display a structured view of the
 * symbol tree, including imports, core modules, and nested symbols.
